# Source and asset notice

This client edition is generated from [buffbeefalo/netmambaplus-reproduction](https://github.com/buffbeefalo/netmambaplus-reproduction). Its manifest records the exact source commit and copied-file identities.

The research reference is [NetMamba+, paper v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.21792v1). Native source is fetched from [wangtz19/NetMambaPlus at commit eec9483e2f0fb84ca22982b9de8149bc3a8b1ad2](https://github.com/wangtz19/NetMambaPlus/tree/eec9483e2f0fb84ca22982b9de8149bc3a8b1ad2), with full tracked-file verification and additional core hashes.

Raw CSV uploads, the paper PDF, upstream source and weights are not mirrored here. The two CSVs must be provided locally to reproduce the uploaded-file packet study. The original flow assets and pretrained checkpoint are fetched from the authors' recorded distribution using [configs/assets.json](configs/assets.json).

The inspected upstream repository root has no license file. Redistribution and commercial terms for inherited data/weights remain unresolved. Public access to this repository, successful downloads and matching hashes do not establish those rights. No new license over third-party materials is asserted by this delivery.
